            %p
              In terms of this the expression for the Lagrangian is brought back to the abstract form it had before rescaling the structure constants by the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coupling+constant"} coupling constant
              %em global
              rescaling of all terms by the
              %em inverse square
              of the coupling constant:
            #eq:MinkowskiYangMillsLagrangianWithCouplingConstantPulledOut.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (4)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi L
